			{" "}
			<p>{"The "}<code>hx-vals</code>{" attribute allows you to add to the parameters that will be submitted with an AJAX request."}</p>
			{" "}
			<p>{"By default, the value of this attribute is a list of name-expression values in "}<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.json.org/json-en.html">JSON (JavaScript Object Notation)</a>{" format."}</p>
			{" "}
			<p>{"If you wish for "}<code>hx-vals</code>{" to "}<em>evaluate</em>{" the values given, you can prefix the values with "}<code>javascript:</code>{" or "}<code>js:</code>.</p>
			{" "}
