			{" "}
			<p>{"In this example, if "}<code>foo()</code>{" returns an object like "}<code>&#123;name: "John", age: 30&#125;</code>{", both "}<code>name</code>{" and "}<code>age</code>{" will be included as parameters in the request."}</p>
			{" "}
