			{" "}
			<p>{"The "}<code>hx-vals</code>{" attribute works with all HTTP methods, including "}<code>hx-post</code>{", "}<code>hx-put</code>{", "}<code>hx-patch</code>{", and "}<code>hx-delete</code>:</p>
